  "rationale": "Moving the distance origin across one edge shortens routes to the child subtree and lengthens all others; subtree sizes transfer totals without repeating BFS for each origin.",
  "commonMistakes": [
    "miss-double-subtree-distance-change",
    "copy-root-total-to-every-node"
  ],
